        { n: 11, prompt: "Guilt is itself an unpleasant ___ that people try to escape.", answer: "emotion", accept: ["emotion"], explanation: "A frase do texto é 'guilt is itself an unpleasant emotion that people try to escape'.", tip: "Leia a frase completa para confirmar que a gramática da lacuna (substantivo singular) coincide." },
        { n: 12, prompt: "Dividing tasks into very small ___ can make the first action seem trivial.", answer: "steps", accept: ["steps"], explanation: "O texto diz 'breaking tasks into very small steps, so that the first action feels trivial'.", tip: "'Dividing' substitui 'breaking'; o verbo do enunciado costuma ser sinónimo do verbo do texto." },
        { n: 13, prompt: "The goal of such methods is to lower the ___ of starting.", answer: "emotional cost", accept: ["emotional cost"], explanation: "A última frase do parágrafo F é 'The aim is not to feel motivated but to lower the emotional cost of starting'.", tip: "Duas palavras seguidas podem formar a resposta; verifique o limite de palavras antes de escrever." }
